              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Keŋaiŋait yes iinacan, kocoito ŋul lueyaunete atiaketa ka nuitiguikinete, asurokin aisisianakin naipotu yesi kisisiata; kinacata kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
